Package: openwrt-ubus-testcorpus
Version: 0.1.0-1
Depends: libc
Section: utils
Architecture: all
Maintainer: cprima
License: MIT
Description: UCI test corpus for saltext-openwrt-ubus development
 Ships known UCI config files to /etc/config/ and integration test
 cases to /usr/share/testcorpus/tests/ covering every UCI data model
 pattern. Reinstall to reset to known state.
